g what was in the bucket and the  support tech when I checked the access  control list to see if I had appropriate  permissions so these are useful you can  grab them they work exactly the same as  all the other logs and stack travel  logging so all the things we've just  covered today around setting up alerts  setting up monitoring those are all  covered you can use this as part of an  automation suite with Google Cloud  functions highly encourage you if you  have platinum or gold support to get  these set up and you can start using  them today so if you want to learn more  about audit logs just Google GCP cloud  audit logging super easy way to find all  of our documentation I've got some  pretty extensive documentation there and  we have some other webinars that are on  the web as well that you can watch or  you can catch up on this talk if you're  not already awesome thanks everyone  [Applause]  [Music]
 

